Z||000009||deceler8||03-13-2001||09:04 AM||||Yes...that is your fan switch. I have the same '86 2.5 car.<P>Also...Yes...get Rodney's fan switch. You'll notice your fan running when it never would before. Just have fun getting the old, busted switch out. The old switch has a stamped metal body that will self-destruct (have the vise grips handy). Rodney's switch is a solid brass casting.||||reg||1
